WEBVTT

00:04:29.584 --> 00:04:31.210
Let that sink in.

00:04:32.998 --> 00:04:34.815
A little bit of good news

00:04:34.839 --> 00:04:40.441
is that places like Belize, Barbuda
and Bonaire are protecting these VIPs --

00:04:40.465 --> 00:04:42.560
Very Important Parrotfish.

00:04:42.879 --> 00:04:47.012
Also, more and more places
are establishing protected areas

00:04:47.036 --> 00:04:49.663
that protect the entire ecosystem.

00:04:50.044 --> 00:04:53.345
These are critical efforts,
but it's not enough.

00:04:54.163 --> 00:04:56.036
As I stand here today,

00:04:56.060 --> 00:04:59.568
only 2.2 percent
of the ocean is protected.

00:04:59.956 --> 00:05:02.717
